  "description": "As descendants of a divine flower, women of the Sacred Bloom tribe have the power to heal all wounds as well as release an irresistible scent that renders all men lovestruck. Ari is the last surviving member of her tribe, but she has yet to learn how to control her mysterious powers. When Prince Dokyeom learns of this, he vows to protect Ari and eventually make her his bride and empress of Dowol. But as Ari's powers awaken, can she keep other men at bay long enough for her to become empress?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
